			],
			"Message": "docs(Echo): Expand Funding section with supporter table and descriptive narrative\n\nAdd a dedicated `<thead>` row labeling each funding partner column (Land, PlayForm, NLnet, NGI0 Commons Fund) and include a contextual sentence introducing Land as an NGI0-supported open-source project. Also introduce the Changelog section with a welcoming \"Stay updated with our progress!\" invitation.\n\nChanges: introduce the Funding section with a sentence positioning Land in the open-source ecosystem; promote the bare table to include a semantic header row; linkify the Land logo anchor to the canonical `editor.land` domain (lowercase); and soften the Changelog call-to-action by replacing the trailing \"Echo\"-specific emphasis with a more inclusive project-wide invite.\n\nResult: a richer, more navigable README that clearly communicates project backing at a glance to visitors scanning the file.",
			"SHA": "a44980670ac0cea16a02d3e720a396d86701c75f"
		},
