				1
			],
			"Message": "style(Echo): Clean up HTML entity clutter in README badges and headings\n\nRemove extraneous `&#x2001;` (em-space) entities from badge rows and section headings in README.md. The badges were padded with invisible entities that visually separated the Rust icon from follow-on badges inconsistently; the System Architecture heading carried a trailing entity that added no semantic value.\n\nAlso reflow the Mountain emoji reference to drop a redundant `&#x2001;` entity before the mountain emoji, keeping a single em-space between the code mention and the emoji character.\n\nResult: cleaner Markdown source with no change to rendered appearance, aligning with project documentation style conventions.",
